{"id":"c94deae06f4e9873","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-commutator.md","title":"Commutator","display":"df-commutator — Commutator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-commutator","aliases":["58-df-commutator"],"display":"df-commutator — Commutator","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-commutator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-commutator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-commutator — Commutator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,c,x,y\\in V\">\\(G,c,x,y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\\subseteq(G\\times G)\\times G\">\\(\\cdot\\subseteq(G\\times G)\\times G\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span> (group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutator}_S\\)</span> (commutator predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutator}_S(c,x,y,G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land x\\in G\\land y\\in G\\land\\exists e,u,v\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\\forall z\\in G\\;(e\\cdot z=z\\land z\\cdot e=z)\\land x\\cdot u=e\\land u\\cdot x=e\\land y\\cdot v=e\\land v\\cdot y=e\\land c=(x\\cdot y)\\cdot(u\\cdot v)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutator}_S(c,x,y,G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land x\\in G\\land y\\in G\\land\\exists e,u,v\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\\forall z\\in G\\;(e\\cdot z=z\\land z\\cdot e=z)\\land x\\cdot u=e\\land u\\cdot x=e\\land y\\cdot v=e\\land v\\cdot y=e\\land c=(x\\cdot y)\\cdot(u\\cdot v)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The commutator is trivial exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> commute.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$ (group predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,c,x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot\\subseteq(G\\times G)\\times G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Commutator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Commutator}_S(c,x,y,G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land x\\in G\\land y\\in G\\land\\exists e,u,v\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\\forall z\\in G\\;(e\\cdot z=z\\land z\\cdot e=z)\\land x\\cdot u=e\\land u\\cdot x=e\\land y\\cdot v=e\\land v\\cdot y=e\\land c=(x\\cdot y)\\cdot(u\\cdot v)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false}],"bytes":861,"backlinks":[{"id":"d092bc2753a71d25","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Commutator}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-commutator.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-commutator.md|58-df-commutator]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734"]}